[x402 Paywall] Bulk upsert routes keyed on (method, path) — paywall a whole API in one call (needs PAYWALL_API_KEY).

Use when you want to paywall many routes in one call (upsert on method and path). Not for a single route (use paywall_create_route).

Behavior: writes state upstream (not read-only);

[Protocol Health Oracle] Track a new protocol. Scored immediately from live GitHub + DeFiLlama data.

Use when a protocol you care about is not tracked yet and you want it scored from live GitHub and DefiLlama data. Not for reading an existing score.

